        {
          "text": "Lino Nahasimu-Amoni wakaya kuyoolwana ku-Jabezi-Gileadi, Mpawo bantu boonse ba-Jabezi-Gileadi bakaambila Nahasi bati, Tuzuminine cizuminano, elyo tulaba bazike bako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
