                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Nahasi mu-Amoni wakabaambila wati, Mwacita obo ndamuzuminina. Umwi aumwi akati kanu nkamugwisye liso lyalulyo, elyo cintu eci ndacibika mbuli cisampauzyo kubaIsrayeli boonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bapati ba-Jabezi bakamwaambila bati, Tulekelele mazuba aali musanu mwaabili, kuti tutume batumwa kuzisi zyoonse zyabaIsrayeli. Lino kuti twabula muntu wakutufutula, tuleza kulinduwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
