        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakabweza iŋombe zyobile, wakazikosaula, wakazituma kuzisi zyoonse zyaba-Israyeli mumaanza aabatumwa, wakaamba wati, Kufumbwa muntu uutakooza kutobela Saulo a-Samuele ulacitilwa obo iŋombe zyakwe. Mpawo kuyoosya kwa-Jehova kwakaselukila bantu nkabela bakazwa camoyo omwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
