        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nibwakaca Saulo wakabika bantu munkamu zyotatwe, nkabela bakanjila mumalabba kuciindi cacifumofumo, bakali kuya buuma ba-Amoni mane kusikila ciindi casikati, nkabela abo ibakasyaala bakamwaika mane teekwakasyaala nibaba bobile antoomwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
