              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bantu boonse bakaya ku-Giligala, bakapa Saulo bwami kubusyu bwa-Jehova nkukonya oko ku-Giligala. Mpawo bakapaila zipaizyo zyakutontozya kubusyu bwa-Jehova, nkabela Saulo wakasekelela cakwiinda abantu boonse ba-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
